<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../layouts/header'); %>
    <title>About · Aaliyah Hänni</title>
  </head>

  <body class="page-body">
    <%- include('../layouts/nav'); %>

    <main id="page-content">
      <section class="section section--light">
        <div class="section__inner about-page-intro">
          <div class="about-page-intro__text" data-aos="fade-right">
            <p class="section-paragraph section-paragraph--muted small-label">About</p>
            <h1 class="section-title">A bit more about me</h1>

            <p class="section-paragraph">
              I’m a Computer Science MSc student at Universität Bern, web developer, data scientist, and IT business
              analyst based in Switzerland. My path brings together mathematics, software, data, design, and practical
              business systems, which helps me move comfortably between technical details and user needs.
            </p>
            <p class="section-paragraph">
              Before Switzerland, I worked in the Seattle area in data science and IT business analysis, building
              dashboards, requirements, reports, internal software workflows, and machine learning prototypes. Today, I
              apply that foundation to web platforms, Swiss-market digital products, e-commerce websites, SEO, API
              integrations, and clean UX.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-page-intro__photo" data-aos="fade-left">
            <div class="about-photo-frame">
              <img src="/tractor.jpg" alt="Aaliyah Hänni and family in Switzerland" class="about-photo-frame__img" />
              <div class="about-photo-frame__badge"><span>Student &amp; builder in Switzerland</span></div>
            </div>
            <p class="about-photo-caption">
              Living and studying in Switzerland shapes how I think about accessible, multilingual and locally useful
              digital products.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section--deep">
        <div class="section__inner">
          <header class="section-header" data-aos="fade-up">
            <h2 class="section-title section-title--center" style="color: #fff;">How I work</h2>
            <p class="section-paragraph section-paragraph--muted section-paragraph--center">
              A mix of technical depth, design judgement, communication, and implementation experience.
            </p>
          </header>

          <div class="about-info-grid">
            <article class="info-card" data-aos="zoom-in-up">
              <h3 class="info-card__title">Technical skills</h3>
              <div class="info-card__body">
                <p><strong>Frontend &amp; Web</strong></p>
                <p class="info-card__line">HTML · CSS · JavaScript · WordPress · Node.js · Responsive design</p>
                <p><strong>Backend &amp; Systems</strong></p>
                <p class="info-card__line">Express · APIs · Webhooks · Authentication · Databases · Cron jobs</p>
                <p><strong>Data &amp; AI</strong></p>
                <p class="info-card__line">Python · R · SQL · Tableau · Machine learning · CNNs · GANs</p>
                <p><strong>Design &amp; Marketing</strong></p>
                <p class="info-card__line">Adobe Suite · SEO · Google Search Console · Google Ads · Content assets</p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="info-card info-card--soft" data-aos="zoom-in-up" data-aos-delay="80">
              <h3 class="info-card__title">Languages</h3>
              <ul class="info-list">
                <li><span class="info-list__label">English</span><span class="info-list__value">Native</span></li>
                <li><span class="info-list__label">German</span><span class="info-list__value">B2.2</span></li>
                <li><span class="info-list__label">Spanish</span><span class="info-list__value">A2</span></li>
              </ul>
            </article>

            <article class="info-card info-card--accent" data-aos="zoom-in-up" data-aos-delay="160">
              <h3 class="info-card__title">Strengths</h3>
              <ul class="info-list info-list--checks">
                <li>Technical translation between users and developers</li>
                <li>Clean, calm and accessible interfaces</li>
                <li>Requirements gathering and documentation</li>
                <li>Data-informed decisions</li>
                <li>Client communication and troubleshooting</li>
              </ul>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section--light">
        <div class="section__inner">
          <header class="section-header" data-aos="fade-up">
            <h2 class="section-title section-title--center">Featured work</h2>
            <p class="section-paragraph section-paragraph--center section-paragraph--muted">
              A few projects that show my current direction across Swiss business discovery, optimization, accessibility and community websites.
            </p>
          </header>

          <div class="project-grid project-grid--four">
            <article class="project-card" data-aos="fade-up">
              <div class="project-card__body">
                <h3 class="project-card__title">Swizzzy</h3>
                <p class="project-card__text">Lead design and development for a Swiss business directory focused on discovery, profiles and local SEO visibility.</p>
                <a href="https://www.swizzzy.ch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="button button--outline">View project</a>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="project-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="80">
              <div class="project-card__body">
                <h3 class="project-card__title">Ant Colony Swiss Trails</h3>
                <p class="project-card__text">Optimization web app exploring ant colony algorithms on Swiss trail route data.</p>
                <a href="http://ant.aaliyahhaenni.ch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="button button--outline">Open web app</a>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="project-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="160">
              <div class="project-card__body">
                <h3 class="project-card__title">OneCourt</h3>
                <p class="project-card__text">Machine learning and real-time haptic sports data work for accessibility-focused sports experiences.</p>
                <a href="https://github.com/aaliyahfiala42/OneCourt" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="button button--outline">View GitHub</a>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="project-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="240">
              <div class="project-card__body">
                <h3 class="project-card__title">Community websites</h3>
                <p class="project-card__text">Web support for nonprofits, youth programs, memorial projects and community organizations.</p>
                <a href="/portfolios" class="button button--outline">Browse portfolio</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('../layouts/footer'); %>
  </body>
</html>
